From efa7b571039988e8f0a96a1967ccdce26bbf1fd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:54:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rear camera, natural free look, remove assists/boost/respawn,
 realistic collisions, Basic/Advanced settings tabs

---
